    "description": "Are you looking for an addictive Classic Solitaire Card Game?\r\n\r\nThe Most Addictive&Relaxing Classic Solitaire Card Games, original Solitaire or Patience, is just for you!\r\n\r\nIntroducing Solitaire Relax\u00ae Big Card Game,Our new classic solitaire card game is an incredible one in Solitaire(Patience) games and card puzzle games, and it is completely FREE!\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best free and popular classic Solitaire card games in the world for free at any time and place! It's time to train your brain, challenge yourself and be a Solitaire or Patience master, try this original, classic and free Patience Solitaire card game!\r\n\r\nPlay the top free and popular original Solitaire card games anytime, anywhere! It's a great way to exercise your brain, challenge yourself, and become a Solitaire or Patience master. Give this free and classic Patience Solitaire card game a try!Solitaire games, also called Patience are card games designed for a single player.No need to worry about spending money \u2013 this isn't a social casino game. Enjoy original Solitaire whenever and wherever you want, with no money involved.\r\n\r\nSolitaire game is an addictive solitaire card game from the Classic card games, which is similar to other Solitaire card/board games, such as Cube, Freecell, Spider, Tri Peaks, Pyramind, Golf, Mahjong and Yukon.  Solitaire, or Patience is the best way for you to relax and pass the time, play it anytime, anywhere. You would absolutely love playing this free Solitaire card game.\r\n\r\nIndulge in the ultimate experience of classic card games with this Solitaire game! Renowned as the world's most popular card game, Solitaire (also known as Patience) offers a delightful blend of relaxation and brain training. Featuring stunning card decks, entertaining animations, and the convenience of free offline play, this basic Solitaire game is your perfect companion for passing the time. With winnable Solitaire decks and visually appealing card sets, Classic Solitaire stands out as one of the most captivating card games globally.\r\n\r\nLooking for FREE enjoyable pastime game for fun? Craving a challenge with card games that test your patience? Look no further than Solitaire Relax\u00ae Big Card Game! Immerse yourself in hours of entertainment with its stunning card decks and seamless gameplay. Explore various game modes, including the classic, Spider, and Freecell variations. What sets the Classic Solitaire cards app apart is its customization options \u2013 personalize the appearance and atmosphere of your Classic Solitaire and Patience games. Download Solitaire Relax\u00ae Big Card Game now to dive into our addictive card games!\r\n\r\nDo you possess the ultimate strategy for conquering Solitaire Relax\u00ae Big Card Game? Choose classic Solitaire to suit your preferences. Take on our daily Solitaire challenges and tailor your Patience cards, table, and Solitaire game modes to match your unique style! Get ready to be hooked on these addictive card puzzles within the realm of Classic Solitaire card games!\r\n\r\n\u2014 Features \u2014\r\n\u00b7 Classic Card Game: Draw 1/3 card modes, standard/Vegas scoring modes, timed/untimed modes, and more options!\r\n\u00b7 Customizable Features: Landscape/portrait mode, left-handed/right-handed options, support for both iphone and ipad, no Wi-Fi required, and more convenience!\r\n\u00b7 Winning Assistance: Unlimited intelligent hints and undo, quick mode to help with card placement, free shuffle when stuck, and more relaxing!\r\n\u00b7 Visual Design: Sleek and elegant interface, clear card designs, large font and eye-friendly theme, diverse backgrounds, and more beautiful!\r\n\u00b7 Special Gameplay: Daily challenges, daily goals, ranks and titles, limited-time events to collect badges, and more challenges!\r\n\r\n\u2014 How to Play \u2014\r\nFor those who are new to the classic card game:\r\nArrange the cards in alternating colors and descending order by clicking or dragging them. If possible, move the cards to the foundation and sort all suits from Ace to King to achieve victory.",
